te_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected in all rendering methods. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_110076.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22050120/test_pr_110076.zip)\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-6000 CL30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 42)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing an editor build, so CPU bottlenecks may be present compared to a release export template.\r\n\r\n### Forward+\r\n\r\n#### 1024×1024 subviewport, no MSAA subviewport, no AF rendering\r\n\r\nNo mipmaps | With mipmaps\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183400\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5997fee3-f26b-4bd0-b169-d74c1bed0752\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183408\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90e5ae53-4a51-4f76-8974-c030ab8b2029\" />\r\n\r\nMipmaps add +0.02 mspf to rendering time.\r\n\r\n#### 1024×1024 subviewport, 8× MSAA subviewport, 16× AF rendering\r\n\r\nNo mipmaps | With mipmaps\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183238\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08f92142-1ad8-474a-8269-fa666ef30c14\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183244\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63d4a5b4-aba8-4b86-b844-98c95856329f\" />\r\n\r\nMipmaps add +0.02 mspf to rendering time.\r\n\r\n#### 4096×4096 subviewport, no MSAA subviewport, no AF rendering\r\n\r\nNo mipmaps | With mipmaps\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183327\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59fbe6d9-aecf-48c3-bdf6-a707035c7fee\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183343\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/852d0f3a-1142-4184-921b-d8f758baace2\" />\r\n\r\nMipmaps add +0.19 mspf to rendering time.\r\n\r\n#### 4096×4096 subviewport, 8× MSAA subviewport, 16× AF rendering\r\n\r\nNo mipmaps | With mipmaps\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183134\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46642358-ba28-46cd-b1d5-f7b1b6a72358\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183148\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ec1950c-964c-455b-a11d-fa49cba535fc\" />\r\n\r\nMipmaps add +0.20 mspf to rendering time.\r\n\r\n### Compatibility\r\n\r\n#### 4096×4096 subviewport, no MSAA subviewport, no AF rendering\r\n\r\nNo mipmaps | With mipmaps\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183613\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15b6c985-7794-44cd-ae78-6eabc1927e4a\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183620\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e87eff4-49c7-46ca-9ec6-4000c4099958\" />\r\n\r\nMipmaps add +0.02 mspf to rendering time.\r\n\r\n#### 4096×4096 subviewport, 8× MSAA subviewport, 16× AF rendering\r\n\r\nNo mipmaps | With mipmaps\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183542\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a153801-7d05-4f3a-bc61-a38fac5feba0\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_183554\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/62b3fa50-1427-4ac6-a8cc-ad681d7dadd6\" />\r\n\r\nMipmaps add +0.04 mspf to rendering time.\r\n\r\n### Bonus: llvmpipe\r\n\r\nForward+, 256×256 subviewport, no MSAA subviewport, 4× AF rendering.\r\n\r\nNo mipmaps | With mipmaps\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_184544\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1efdfa7e-7561-47d0-863e-8f0b23a756f6\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Screenshot_20250829_184556\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bad664ee-c9cd-4524-8b21-468289bbba71\" />\r\n\r\nMipmaps add +0.40 mspf to rendering time (although llvmpipe performance is quite variable over time, likely due to CPU boost/thermal limits).","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076#pullrequestreview-3169412479","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110076","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076#pullrequestreview-3169412479"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110076"}},"submitted_at":"2025-08-29T16:48:49Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3167729692,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc68z7gc","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110076#pullrequestreview-3167729692","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110076","author_asso